        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(ui): surface a visible error when the local user avatar fails to save (#110662)",
        "body": "Focused, single-commit resubmission (supersedes #110942, which accidentally carried an unrelated stacked commit). Touches ONLY the avatar-save-error fix: 4 files, +79/-13.\n\n## Summary\n\nUploading a USER avatar in the Control UI could silently fail: `saveLocalUserIdentity` swallowed storage-write exceptions and `setLocalUserAvatar` flipped the in-memory avatar anyway, so the UI showed the new avatar while nothing was persisted (#110662).\n\n## Fix\n\n- `ui/src/app/settings.ts`: `saveLocalUserIdentity` now lets storage-write failures propagate instead of swallowing them.\n- `ui/src/pages/config/config-page.ts`: `setLocalUserAvatar` catches the failure, records `userAvatarError`, and keeps the prior avatar rather than showing an un-persisted one.\n- `ui/src/pages/config/quick.ts`: renders `userAvatarError` as `role=\"alert\"`.\n\n## Tests\n\n`vitest` on the ui workspace: `config-page.test.ts` 10 passed, `quick.test.ts` 37 passed, `settings.node.test.ts` 32 passed — including 2 new regression tests. oxlint 0/0; oxfmt clean.\n\nCloses #110662",
